CloudOps Tools Monorepo License Notice

This repository is a monorepo. Licensing is defined per package, not globally.

Please refer to the package-specific license files:

- CLI package (`@cloudops-tools/cli`): `cli/LICENSE`
- SDK package (`@cloudops-tools/sdk`): `sdk/LICENSE`
- Documentation package (`@cloudops-tools/documentation`): `documentation/LICENSE`

Each package is distributed under the terms of its own `LICENSE` file.
